e role of Samantha Burkhart. Sent by her mother to inspect an abandoned amusement park inherited from her late father, the 19-year-old woman is overwhelmed by memories of her childhood. To come to terms with her past, Samantha explores the park and solves puzzles in this redirected-walking adventure.\n\nA FAMILY HISTORY\n\nSet in the 1920s, the story of The Amusement draws on the scars of the post-war period. At her mother's request, Samantha visits the family amusement park for one last inspection: a winding maze, the ruins of Atlantis... and of course, roller coasters! \n\nREDIRECTED WALKING\n\nThe Amusement offers a redirected walking exploration experience: every step the player takes is immediately transcribed into the game. Players will need a 4-square-meter space to walk around and climb the game's structures.\nNote that it is also possible to move around using controller-based movements. \n\nINTERACTIVE GAMEPLAY\n\nPlayers can manipulate objects to search for clues and find their way through the park. Virtual reality allows for better interaction with the environment, enabling a holistic and concrete resolution of the puzzles.\n\nFeatures\n\n- Vintage settings inspired by 1920s amusement parks\n- Redirected-walking technology \n- A complex story about family relationships\n- Interactive puzzles", "short_description": "An abandoned amusement park, a tangled memory, a family shattered by the Great War\u2026 Discover an intense story in this redirected-walking VR adventure in which every step counts."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "14.png", "id": "24751699111146210", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_24751699114479543_4078140076310124482_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XEUZ_-_vBBEQ7kNvwGPC1sK&_nc_oc=AdpSyku_8rhcjfeVpe44Hj6GLC7-5HlWtLO4rkdA_dSWYnnONYq1fuZj_uJamyQFkHk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9s76IDe_JqW2jUdwB4GOAJJbvQglU283ejdJPoYZekVA&oe=6A4119B5"}, {"file_name": "15.png", "id": "1248901740608471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_1248901747275137_8872588395523507086_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JXxrWU7l29QQ7kNvwEYjAJp&_nc_oc=AdqE-C9TfYqq1o3blUPljf86asRIaNlQXe_cn1SC-zVahWzYc063lssSV1QyF0uXuKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_lGBmRnF8PRExwD7MPA0uRcoDjKs7CVUsx6PQmMHzA9w&oe=6A411600"}, {"file_name": "13.png", "id": "822211500402478", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828008_822211503735811_6750484965255036463_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7z0fnkCfb3wQ7kNvwGnjcg5&_nc_oc=AdoWG8hYDe9APlhvKy0BOVXcsO-zJID3-fjrfLRd-54PK6RuVYkYQxgpQLPJWMaFiMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_RNH2ClPwCgIcmHQOcd-Z4cc2NWKzOi0iJKrg_kKT0DA&oe=6A413305"}]}, "id": "811505128154656", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The Amusement", "keywords": ["steampunk", "narrative", "puzzle"], "long_description": "The Amusement est un jeu narratif en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans lequel le joueur incarne Samantha Burkhart. Envoy\u00e9e par sa m\u00e8re pour inspecter un parc d\u2019attractions abandonn\u00e9 h\u00e9rit\u00e9 de son p\u00e8re disparu, la jeune femme de 19 ans est envahie de souvenirs de son enfance. Pour faire face \u00e0 son pass\u00e9, Samantha explore le parc et r\u00e9sout des \u00e9nigmes dans cette aventure en redirected-walking.\n\nUNE HISTOIRE FAMILIALE\n\nPrenant place dans les ann\u00e9es 20, l\u2019histoire de The Amusement s\u2019appuie sur les cicatrices de l'apr\u00e8s-guerre. \u00c0 la demande de sa m\u00e8re, Samantha se rend dans le parc d\u2019attractions familial pour une derni\u00e8re inspection : un labyrinthe tortueux, les ruines de l'Atlantide\u2026 et bien s\u00fbr, des montagnes russes ! \n\nREDIRECTED-WALKING\n\nThe Amusement propose une exploration en redirected-walking : chaque pas que le joueur fait est retranscrit imm\u00e9diatement dans le jeu. Le joueur aura besoin d\u2019une surface de 4 m\u00e8tres carr\u00e9 pour marcher mais aussi escalader les structures du jeu.\n\u00c0 noter qu\u2019il est possible de se d\u00e9placer \u00e0 la manette. \n\nUN GAMEPLAY INTERACTIF\n\nLe joueur peut manipuler des objets pour chercher des indices et trouver son chemin \u00e0 travers le parc. La r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle permet une meilleure interaction avec l\u2019environnement, pour une r\u00e9solution holistique et concr\u00e8te des \u00e9nigmes.\n\nCaract\u00e9ristiques\n\n- Des d\u00e9cors d'\u00e9poque inspir\u00e9s des Luna Park des ann\u00e9es 20\n- Une technologie redirected-walking \n- Une histoire complexe sur les relations familiales\n- Des \u00e9nigmes interactives", "short_description": "Un parc d\u2019attractions abandonn\u00e9, des souvenirs enfouis, une famille fractur\u00e9e par la Grande Guerre... D\u00e9couvrez un intense r\u00e9cit introspectif \u00e0 travers cette aventure VR en redirected-walking o\u00f9 chaque pas compte."}]}, "developer_name": "Curvature Games, ARTE France", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://curvaturegames.com/footer/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ARTE France", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.arte.tv/digitalproductions/en/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_process